  "id": "dantrolene",
  "term": "dantrolene",
  "definition": "Dantrolene is a skeletal muscle relaxant that reduces muscle contraction by disrupting the link between nerve activation and muscle fiber contraction. It is used for spasticity and other neuromuscular problems, and although its action is probably not in the central nervous system, it is often grouped with central muscle relaxants.",
